/* CLOSEFLOW_STAGE149_CLEAN_DESKTOP_APP_SHELL_CANVAS
   Final reset after Stage136-148 width experiments.

   Problem found by audit:
   - html/body/#root/app are rendered in a tiny CSS viewport while the browser window is physically wide.
   - later stages tried to stretch children, scale root, or overrun containers.
   - this made the blue bug-selection frame and cards look clipped.

   Best practice for operator/CRM desktop shell:
   - keep a stable desktop canvas with a minimum usable width;
   - sidebar is a fixed rail;
   - main work area is minmax(0, 1fr);
   - route roots fill main;
   - no transforms, no scale runtime, no 100%+overrun hacks.
*/

