/* CLOSEFLOW_STAGE158_OVERLAY_PORTAL_DENSITY_SOURCE_TRUTH
   Problem:
   - Stage157 makes the main app at 100% look like browser zoom 80%.
   - Dialogs/modals/popovers are often rendered in portals under <body>.
   - Portaled overlays do not inherit #root > .app zoom, so they stay visually too large.

   Goal:
   - apply the same visual density scale to all subwindows/overlays:
     dialogs, modals, sheets, popovers, dropdowns, menus, command panels, tooltips, toasts.
   - keep overlays anchored and centered naturally.
   - do not touch Stage149 width source truth.
   - do not scale the entire body/html/root.

   Source truth:
   - Stage157 = page/app viewport zoom source truth
   - Stage158 = overlay/portal density source truth
*/

