/* CLOSEFLOW_STAGE159_OVERLAY_REAL_DENSITY_AND_FOOTER_FIX
   Problem after Stage158:
   - Stage157 page zoom works for main app.
   - Stage158 used zoom on portaled dialog content.
   - That makes some subwindows drift horizontally and can clip/cover form text.
   - Event dialog footer/action bar can sit over content instead of behaving as a real bottom action row.
   - Lead/task dialogs should fit without unnecessary scrolling where possible.

   Stage159 decision:
   - keep Stage157 as app scale source truth;
   - do NOT zoom dialog content;
   - use real overlay density tokens: width, max-height, padding, gaps, control height, font sizes;
   - force dialog content to be viewport-centered;
   - force dialog body to be scroll-safe;
   - force action rows/footers to live at the bottom and not cover text.

   This stage intentionally overrides Stage158 dialog zoom.
*/

